sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(62,111,160) Client
    participant U as User
  end
  box rgb(58,128,84) Edge
    participant W as Web
  end
  box rgb(165,87,38) Identity
    participant A as AuthSvc
    participant M as MFA
  end
  box rgb(116,87,184) Persistence
    participant D as Database
    participant Q as JobQueue
  end
  box rgb(90,106,126) External
    participant S as ThirdPartySSO
  end

  U->>W: login submit
  activate W
  W->>A: validate credentials
  activate A
  alt credentials valid
    A->>D: load profile
    D-->>A: profile rows
    opt MFA required
      A->>M: issue challenge
      M-->>U: prompt
      loop up to 3 attempts
        U->>M: code
        alt code matches
          M-->>A: ok
        else code wrong
          M-->>U: retry
        end
      end
    end
    par notify downstream
      A->>Q: enqueue welcome email
    and start SSO bridge
      A->>S: bridge session
      S-->>A: token
    end
    A-->>W: session cookie
  else credentials invalid
    A->>D: increment fail counter
    D-->>A: ok
    A-->>W: 401
  end
  deactivate A
  W-->>U: response
  deactivate W

  Note over U,S: end-to-end happy path crosses 5 nested control blocks
